## Why This Question Is Asked
This question assesses the ability to design a beginner-level CAPA process for shared resources and governance, rather than implementing quick fixes alone.

## Key Concepts
- CAPA data model
- Lifecycle state machine
- Evidence-rich REST API
- Operational metrics
- RCA templates and canary remediation

## Code Example
```javascript
// Minimal Express API scaffolding for /caps
const express = require('express')
const app = express()
app.use(express.json())
let caps = []

app.post('/caps', (req, res) => {
  const cap = { id: Date.now().toString(), ...req.body }
  caps.push(cap)
  res.status(201).json(cap)
})

app.get('/caps', (req, res) => {
  res.json(caps)
})

app.listen(3000, () => console.log('CAPA service running'))
```

